# Private Super Admin URLs. They are baked into the website when it is BUILT, so on Vercel add them as
# Environment Variables BEFORE deploying (and redeploy after changing them). Always start with /
# If these are not set, the guessable defaults /secure-access-bmyf and /bmyfsuperadminsignup are used.
VITE_SUPER_ADMIN_PATH=/choose-your-own-secret-signin-path
VITE_SUPER_ADMIN_SIGNUP_PATH=/choose-your-own-secret-signup-path
